# Code of conduct
{.lead} Be respectful and considerate; harassment is not acceptable in any project space.

This project follows the [Contributor Covenant](https://www.contributor-covenant.org/version/2/1/code_of_conduct/), version 2.1.

---

## In short

Be respectful and considerate. Harassment, insults, and other unwelcome behavior are not acceptable in any project space, public or private.

---

## Reporting

If you experience or witness unacceptable behavior, report it privately.

:::callout note
Email Barprojectsandbuilds@gmail.com. Reports are handled confidentially. Maintainers may take any action they consider appropriate, up to and including a ban.
:::

The full standards and enforcement guidelines are at the Contributor Covenant link above.
